{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12380","headline":"送沈仲 · 钱起","name":"送沈仲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天朴非外假，至人常晏如。\n心期邈霄汉，词律响琼琚。\n举酒常叹息，无人达子虚。\n夜光失隋掌，骥騄伏盐车。\n考室晋山下，归田秦岁初。\n寒云随路合，落照下城余。\n千里还同术，无劳怨索居。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12380.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12380","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}